  "nonClaims": [
    "A successful helper call is not physical power-loss evidence.",
    "A successful helper call is not proof that a storage device ignored no flush request.",
    "A successful helper call does not prove create-only publication, file-data fsync, readback, or receipt admission by itself.",
    "The helper does not establish single-writer ownership; the caller must prevent independent mutation of the owned root for the operation lifetime.",
    "A local Windows observation is not cross-platform or production deployment evidence."
  ],
